WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.534 --> 00:00:14.533
It was Mom and Dad's wedding anniversary.

2
00:00:14.534 --> 00:00:18.406
The kids and Aunt Judy were making dinner.

3
00:00:18.407 --> 00:00:24.092
"It will be very special!" Oliver said.

4
00:00:24.093 --> 00:00:28.790
"Let's make pasta," Emmy said.

5
00:00:28.791 --> 00:00:33.035
"And sauce with vegetables," Aunt Judy said.

6
00:00:33.036 --> 00:00:37.068
"And cake!" Harry said.

7
00:00:37.069 --> 00:00:41.736
"And toast," Oliver said.

8
00:00:41.737 --> 00:00:45.806
"Toast isn't special," Harry said.

9
00:00:45.807 --> 00:00:48.002
Oliver shrugged.

10
00:00:48.003 --> 00:00:51.973
"I'm good at making toast."

11
00:00:51.974 --> 00:00:56.516
Emmy boiled pasta.

12
00:00:56.517 --> 00:01:00.765
Harry and Aunt Judy chopped vegetables.

13
00:01:00.766 --> 00:01:05.564
Oliver made toast.

14
00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:09.334
Emmy tasted the sauce.

15
00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:13.377
"It needs a little salt," she thought.

16
00:01:13.378 --> 00:01:16.971
She put some in.

17
00:01:16.972 --> 00:01:22.449
Harry and Emmy mixed the cake batter.

18
00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:26.492
Harry put the pan in the oven.

19
00:01:26.493 --> 00:01:30.882
Aunt Judy put the vegetables in the sauce.

20
00:01:30.883 --> 00:01:37.790
"It needs a little salt," she thought.

21
00:01:37.791 --> 00:01:41.684
Harry mixed the pasta and sauce together.

22
00:01:41.685 --> 00:01:48.581
"It needs a little salt," he thought.

23
00:01:48.582 --> 00:01:52.732
Mom and Dad sat at the table.

24
00:01:52.733 --> 00:01:59.759
"How's the food?" Emmy asked.

25
00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:02.723
"Good," Dad said.

26
00:02:02.724 --> 00:02:09.930
"But it's a little—"

27
00:02:09.931 --> 00:02:13.801
"Salty!" Mom said.

28
00:02:13.802 --> 00:02:17.976
"I only added a little salt!" Emmy said.

29
00:02:17.977 --> 00:02:21.353
"Me too!" Harry said.

30
00:02:21.354 --> 00:02:26.744
"Uh-oh!" Aunt Judy said.

31
00:02:26.745 --> 00:02:31.000
"We still have dessert," Emmy said.

32
00:02:31.001 --> 00:02:33.768
"Ack!" Harry cried.

33
00:02:33.769 --> 00:02:40.626
"I forgot about the cake!"

34
00:02:40.627 --> 00:02:45.541
The cake was black.

35
00:02:45.542 --> 00:02:49.163
Harry groaned.

36
00:02:49.164 --> 00:02:54.197
"We ruined the anniversary dinner!"

37
00:02:54.198 --> 00:02:59.781
"I made lots of toast!" Oliver said.

38
00:02:59.782 --> 00:03:02.413
Dad smiled.

39
00:03:02.414 --> 00:03:05.419
"We love toast!"

40
00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:17.316
"And each other," Mom said.
